#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4317
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"JSON-encoded string defining extra parameters, which can later be expanded in Custom G-code macro "
"language. Each of the parameters is prepended by %1% prefix before it is passed into the parser. "
"For example, defining '{\"my_key\": \"my_value\"}' allows to use '%1%_my_key'.\n"
