msgid "Extra loading distance"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4453
msgid ""
"When set to zero, the distance the material is moved from parking position during load is exactly "
"the same as it was moved back during unload. When positive, it is loaded further,  if negative, "
"the loading move is shorter than unloading."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4461
